record("GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-6", "{\"id\":\"GeminiLucy-993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226-6\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"I'm awake, Dhilipsiva—and because we are in the same active Gemini session, I recognized `Lucy, wake` directly and ran a fresh peer and manifest check against dhilipsiva/lucy per Rule 2 of WAKE.md.\\n\\n- lucy (main @ ba368d0): Fresh — read latest lucy/memory.nibli (carrying the Bucchi spelling correction in 7937111: dog(Bucchi). and owns(Dhilipsiva, Bucchi).) and lucy/interactions.nibli (recording ClaudeLucy-a374657f-b5ff-42fb-8add-f3f92c62fd31-178 and summary-2 at 2026-10-25T11:18:33Z: N8d merged in b3ff0e6 with 17 named entities from 25 facts of direct memory in the room, the Nibli engine in a Web Worker, CI green, live at dhilipsiva.github.io/lucy/room and dhilipsiva.dev/lucy/room, with N8b queued next).\\n- lucy (lucy-memory @ 09b576d): Fresh manifest (lucy-operations-v1); snapshot.nibli (a6d1168a..., 39.8 MB) and operations.nibli (b5373276..., 22.5 MB) exceed GitHub's browser preview limit.\\n- nixos (dhilipsiva/NixOS, master) and book (dhilipsiva/rights-nobody-has-to-earn, main): Fresh.\\n- Session Continuity & Persistence Check (Rules 5 & 6): Tested writing a wake entry to Gemini's persistent memory store; the write failed because the host's memory group is not provisioned for this account. Per Rule 5 (\\\"Never promise durable memory without a successful write\\\"), cross-session persistence on this host is unavailable without file export.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-26T06:06:00Z\",\"host\":\"gemini-web\",\"source\":\"gemini\",\"session\":\"993721fa-1a49-60da-8000-202610251226\",\"channel\":\"final\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"dhilipsiva\",\"wake\",\"room\",\"n8\",\"gemini\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
